Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for The Shaper's Terrace, a Forever dungeon on the northern rim of Un'Goro Crater \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 58-60 The Shapers Terrace]
[NX 58-60 Upper Blackrock Spire]

Every quest here needs level 55. Horde gets three quests (Undercity and Mulgore), Alliance three (Ironforge, one of them found inside the dungeon).

-- Horde pickups: Undercity, the zeppelin to Orgrimmar, Mulgore, then the long walk south to Un'Goro.
[A Horde] Start in Undercity. At Michael Garrett, get the Undercity flight path [P Undercity] [G63.1,48.3 Undercity]
[A Horde] In the Apothecarium, Chemist Fuely gives [QA97049 Essence of Seeping Slimes] [G47.5,73.3 Undercity]
[A Horde] Master Apothecary Faranell gives [QA95926 The Dark Crystal] [G48.8,69.3 Undercity] \\ Anya Rince (level 52) close by may attack.
[A Horde] Leave Undercity and walk to the zeppelin towers [G56.8,17.2 Undercity][G61.8,65.0 Tirisfal Glades][G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades] [OC] \\ A Decrepit Harvester (elite, level 8) roams near the towers.
[A Horde] Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades]
[A Horde] From the tower, walk into Orgrimmar by the main gate [G51.0,13.9 Durotar][G45.5,12.0 Durotar] [OC] \\ An Infernal (elite, level 30) and a Dustwind Eggtender (elite, level 12) may be near the tower.
[A Horde] At Doras, get the Orgrimmar flight path [P Orgrimmar] [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] Out of the gate, down the Durotar road and over the Southfury bridge [G45.5,12.0 Durotar][G45.5,25.7 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar][G61.8,20.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Halikor (elite, level 12) may be by the road.
[A Horde] West past the Crossroads to the Mulgore pass [G51.0,20.0 The Barrens][G52.0,30.0 The Barrens][G43.0,31.0 The Barrens][G35.5,27.5 The Barrens] [OC] \\ A Razormane Berserker (elite, level 18-19) may roam north of the Crossroads.
[A Horde] Over the ridge into Mulgore and west up onto the Skywatcher Plateau [G49.9,15.0 Mulgore][G42.1,24.9 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore][G35.0,22.5 Mulgore] [OC] \\ Enforcer Emilgund (elite) may roam the plains.
[A Horde] Mayena Earthseeker gives [QA95928 Crystalline Elements] [G34.9,22.1 Mulgore]
[A Horde] Down off the plateau to the Thunder Bluff lift and up [G35.0,22.5 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore][G39.0,33.1 Mulgore] [OC]
[A Horde] At Tal, get the Thunder Bluff flight path [P Thunder Bluff] [G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff]
[A Horde] Back down the lift and out of Mulgore to the Barrens [G39.0,33.1 Mulgore][G42.1,24.9 Mulgore][G49.9,15.0 Mulgore][G35.5,27.5 The Barrens][G43.0,31.0 The Barrens][G52.0,30.0 The Barrens] [OC]
[A Horde] South from the Crossroads on the road to the Great Lift [G52.0,30.0 The Barrens][G52.0,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G46.3,57.5 The Barrens][G45.5,66.0 The Barrens][G44.7,78.2 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Camp Taurajo is beside the road. Azzere the Skyblade (elite 25), Hagg Taurenbane (elite 26) and the Razorfen elites (33-34) by the Great Lift may attack.

-- Alliance pickups: Ironforge, then Menethil, the boat to Theramore and the walk south.
[A Alliance] Start in Ironforge. At Gryth Thurden, get the Ironforge flight path [P Ironforge] [G55.9,47.9 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] In the Hall of Explorers, Curator Thorius gives [QA95924 Panic at the Digsite] [QA95925 Mapping the Way Forward] [G71.5,15.7 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Out of Ironforge and down to the Dun Morogh road, then east to the North Gate Pass [G53.6,33.9 Dun Morogh][G51.6,39.8 Dun Morogh][G56.9,47.1 Dun Morogh][G62.6,54.7 Dun Morogh][G67.0,52.5 Dun Morogh][G76.0,48.5 Dun Morogh][G81.5,41.0 Dun Morogh][G84.1,33.8 Dun Morogh] [OC] \\ Hammerspine (elite 12) and Ghostfang (elite 10) roam near the road.
[A Alliance] Through the pass and north to Dun Algaz [G20.7,17.5 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan] [OC]
[A Alliance] North into the Wetlands and west along the road to Menethil Harbor [G55.1,73.7 Wetlands][G57.0,49.5 Wetlands][G49.5,40.0 Wetlands][G35.0,40.5 Wetlands][G26.3,40.5 Wetlands][G23.4,42.5 Wetlands][G22.4,44.0 Wetlands][G14.0,47.0 Wetlands][G12.3,52.2 Wetlands] [OC] \\ Elite Dragonmaw orcs (29-30), Modr, the Goaz Warder and a Nightveiled Rotheap (31-32), Highland Lurkers, Horrors and Elder Crocolisks (27-29) live near the road.
[A Alliance] At Shellei Brondir, get the Menethil Harbor flight path [P Menethil Harbor] [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Walk to the south pier [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands] [OC]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Theramore [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Off the pier and get the Theramore flight path [P Theramore] [G67.5,51.2 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] North out of Theramore along the shore road into the Barrens [G66.8,48.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G64.5,44.6 Dustwallow Marsh][G64.0,41.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G63.0,38.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.9,32.5 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.3,27.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G57.2,20.8 Dustwallow Marsh][G55.7,17.4 Dustwallow Marsh][G55.0,16.5 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC]
[A Alliance] West across the Barrens to the south road, then south to the top of the Great Lift [G52.0,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G47.5,58.0 The Barrens][G45.5,66.0 The Barrens][G44.7,78.2 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Camp Taurajo (Horde) is beside the road. Azzere the Skyblade (elite 25), Hagg Taurenbane (elite 26) and the Razorfen elites (33-34) by the Great Lift may attack.

-- Both: Thousand Needles, Tanaris, Un'Goro.
Ride the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles [G32.1,24.2 Thousand Needles] [OC]
Down the canyon to the Shimmering Flats [G39.6,33.5 Thousand Needles][G45.1,41.7 Thousand Needles][G48.9,54.0 Thousand Needles][G55.0,56.0 Thousand Needles][G67.0,60.0 Thousand Needles][G70.0,72.0 Thousand Needles][G66.4,90.8 Thousand Needles] [OC] \\ Elites on the way: Ailgrha Splittusk (38) and a Ravaging Tempest (40) in the canyon, Stormheart (30) and Vile Sting (35) on the flats, a Silithid Ravager (37) at the south end.
South over the dunes into Tanaris [G41.2,6.0 Tanaris][G44.3,11.1 Tanaris][G44.5,13.7 Tanaris][G45.3,16.3 Tanaris][G49.0,17.0 Tanaris][G51.8,18.8 Tanaris][G51.7,21.5 Tanaris][G51.6,25.5 Tanaris] [OC]
[A Horde] At Bulkrek Ragefist, get the Gadgetzan flight path [P Gadgetzan] [G51.6,25.5 Tanaris]
[A Alliance] At Bera Stonehammer, get the Gadgetzan flight path [P Gadgetzan] [G51.0,29.3 Tanaris] \\ A Gadgetzan Enforcer (level 57) stands nearby.
North-west out of Tanaris toward the Un'Goro rim [G41.1,27.6 Tanaris][G37.6,22.4 Tanaris][G35.0,17.2 Tanaris][G31.5,11.9 Tanaris][G28.0,7.5 Tanaris] [OC] \\ Sandfury trolls (elite, level 42-45) stand outside Zul'Farrak near 38-41,21-28: keep east of them.
Down into Un'Goro Crater and west along the northern rim [G67.8,4.0 Un'Goro Crater][G64.6,4.1 Un'Goro Crater][G61.3,6.7 Un'Goro Crater][G58.5,8.9 Un'Goro Crater][G55.3,8.6 Un'Goro Crater] [OC] \\ Un'Goro raptors and devilsaurs (level 48-55) roam the crater floor; Pterrordaxes (50-52) fly along this rim.
At Gryfe in Marshal's Refuge, get the Marshal's Refuge flight path [P Marshal's Refuge] [G45.2,5.8 Un'Goro Crater]
Climb the hill just east of Marshal's Refuge and take the stairs up into the titan temple [G48.1,6.1 Un'Goro Crater]

-- Inside.
[A Horde] Collect the Moist, Charged, Noxious and Fiery Crystals for [QC95928 Crystalline Elements]
[A Horde] Gather 8 Seeping Slime Essence from the slimes in the pools [QC97049 Essence of Seeping Slimes]
[A Horde] Take a Drained Crystal Fragment from beside the Achromatic Crystal [QC95926 The Dark Crystal]
[A Alliance] Kill Venomridge, 6 Ravasaur Matriarchs and 8 Ironhide Ravasaurs [QC95924 Panic at the Digsite]
[A Alliance] Map the five landmarks with the Cartographer's Kit: the Pillar of Assimilation, the Achromatic Crystal, the Western Gates, the Regrowth Vestibule and the Unearthed Stone [QC95925 Mapping the Way Forward]
[A Alliance] In the Verdant Plains, click the Partially Digested Journal on the ground [QA95790 Digestible Research] \\ It cannot be shared; each player clicks it.
[A Alliance] Collect 15 Partially Digested Journal Pages [QC95790 Digestible Research]

-- Turn-ins.
[A Horde] Leave the dungeon and fly to Thunder Bluff [F Thunder Bluff] [G45.2,5.8 Un'Goro Crater]
[A Horde] Down the lift and out to the Skywatcher Plateau [G39.0,33.1 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore][G35.0,22.5 Mulgore] [OC]
[A Horde] Mayena Earthseeker takes [QT95928 Crystalline Elements] [G34.9,22.1 Mulgore]
[A Horde] Back to the lift and up to Tal [G35.0,22.5 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore][G39.0,33.1 Mulgore] [OC]
[A Horde] Fly to Orgrimmar [F Orgrimmar] [G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff]
[A Horde] Out of the gate to the zeppelin tower [G45.5,12.0 Durotar][G51.0,13.9 Durotar] [OC]
[A Horde] Take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades [G51.0,13.9 Durotar]
[A Horde] Walk south into Undercity [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades][G61.8,65.0 Tirisfal Glades][G56.8,17.2 Undercity] [OC]
[A Horde] Chemist Fuely takes [QT97049 Essence of Seeping Slimes] [G47.5,73.3 Undercity]
[A Horde] Master Apothecary Faranell takes [QT95926 The Dark Crystal] [G48.8,69.3 Undercity]
[A Alliance] Leave the dungeon and fly to Theramore [F Theramore] [G45.2,5.8 Un'Goro Crater] \\ QuestieDB lists the Theramore Guards (level 57) as hostile; they are the town's own guards.
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Menethil Harbor [G71.6,56.4 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] Fly to Ironforge [F Ironforge] [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Curator Thorius takes [QT95924 Panic at the Digsite] [QT95925 Mapping the Way Forward] [QT95790 Digestible Research] [G71.5,15.7 Ironforge]
